      {
        "label": "Caption",
        "value": "\u00f0\u009f\u008e\u00acLove with Flaws\u00e2\u009d\u00a4\u00ef\u00b8\u008f\u00f0\u009f\u00a4\u0097\n\u00e2\u0080\u008bPlatform: Viki / Kocowa / Prime Video\n@kcdrama.love_stor\n\u00e2\u0080\u008bPlot:\n\u00e2\u0080\u008bJoo Seo Yeon (Oh Yeon Seo) is a high school PE teacher with a very specific \"allergy\": she absolutely detests handsome men. After growing up with three incredibly good-looking brothers who caused her nothing but trouble and heartache, she has decided that \"pretty boys\" are nothing but a headache. She is strictly looking for someone who is average or even \"ugly\" to live a peaceful life.\n\u00e2\u0080\u008bEnter Lee Kang Woo (Ahn Jae Hyun), a man who is obsessed with his appearance. In middle school, he was rejected by Seo Yeon because he was \"fat and ugly,\" a trauma that led to a severe case of irritable bowel syndrome whenever he faces stress and a desperate need to be perfect. Now a chaebol heir and a visual perfectionist, he reunites with Seo Yeon to overcome his past trauma and get his revenge. As they clash over their polar opposite views on beauty, they begin to see past each other's \"flaws\" and discover that true love isn't about looks\u00e2\u0080\u0094it's about the heart.\n\u00e2\u0080\u008b[RomCom, Enemies to Lovers, Healing, Misunderstandings, Family, Visual vs Personality]\n\u00e2\u0080\u008b#lovewithflaws\n#explorepage\n#kdramas\n#ahnjaehyun\n#ohyeonseo"
